{
  "dom_id": "step-e5125",
  "name": "Example: Splitting a Rational Expression With Three Terms in the Numerator",
  "problem": "Given that $\\dfrac{1 − 2a + 16b}{4} = p + qa + rb,$ what are the values of $p,$ $q,$ and $r?$",
  "worked_solution": "Splitting the fraction into separate terms and then simplifying the fractions in the individual terms, we get\n\n$$\n\\eqalign{\n\t\t\\dfrac{1 − 2a + 16b}{4} &= \\\n\t\t\\dfrac 1 4 − \\dfrac {2a} {4} + \\dfrac {16b}{4} &= \\\n\t\t\\dfrac 1 4 − \\dfrac {2} {4} \\cdot a + \\dfrac {16}{4} \\cdot b &= \\\n\t\t\\dfrac 1 4 − \\dfrac {1} {2} \\cdot a + 4 \\cdot b &= \\\t\t\n\t\t\\dfrac 1 4 − \\dfrac {a} {2} + 4b &= \\\n                \\dfrac{1}{4} - \\dfrac{1}{2}a + 4b &.\n\t}\n$$\n\nWriting the above in the form $p+qa+rb,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{{(\\frac{1}{4})}_{⏟}}_{p}+{{(-\\frac{1}{2})}_{⏟}}_{q}a+{{(4)}_{⏟}}_{r}b.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, $p=\\dfrac{1}{4},$ $q=-\\dfrac{1}{2},$ and $r=4.$",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
  "fields": [],
  "problem_field_keys": [],
  "answer_fields_complete": null,
  "result": null,
  "proof_feedback": null,
  "html": "<div id=\"step-e5125\" class=\"step\" style=\"display: block;\">\n    \n                 \n                <div class=\"example\">\n                    <div class=\"stepHeader\">\n                        <div class=\"stepName\"><span class=\"stepType\">Example:</span> Splitting a Rational Expression With Three Terms in the Numerator</div>       \n                        <div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"e5125\">?</div>\n                    </div>\n            \n                    <div class=\"exampleQuestion\">\n                        <style type=\"text/css\">\n                            .mjpage .MJX-monospace {\n                            font-family: monospace\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage .MJX-sans-serif {\n                            font-family: sans-serif\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage {\n                            display: inline;\n                            font-style: normal;\n                            font-weight: normal;\n                            line-height: normal;\n                            font-size: 100%;\n                            font-size-adjust: none;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            text-align: left;\n                            text-transform: none;\n                            letter-spacing: normal;\n                            word-spacing: normal;\n                            word-wrap: normal;\n                            white-space: nowrap;\n                            float: none;\n                            direction: ltr;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            padding: 0;\n                            margin: 0\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage * {\